      "node_id": "kg_doc_10",
      "node_type": "kg",
      "content": "\"The Gate\" is a song recorded by Icelandic musician Björk. It was released on 15 September 2017 through One Little Indian as the lead single from her ninth studio album, \"Utopia\" (2017). The song was written and produced by Björk and Arca.",
